==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Geodude}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Alolan Geodude|40}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*'''Knuckle Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Revelation|Geodude|44}} from the {{TCG|Neo Revelation}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

